{"id":"a16z-dharmesh-shah-hubspot-startup-2026-11-10","title":"HubSpot’s Co-Founder on Finding Your Next Startup Idea","guest":"Dharmesh Shah（HubSpot 联合创始人兼 CTO）；主持 Joe Schmidt（a16z Partner）","show":"a16z Show","date":"2026-11-10","duration":"59分钟","category":"创始人·CEO·产品","topics":["founders-product","enterprise-apps","agents-tooling","markets-vc"],"priority":"P1","summary":"面对前沿实验室把模型能力延伸到应用层，创业公司该站在哪里？a16z 的 Joe Schmidt 与 HubSpot 联合创始人兼 CTO Dharmesh Shah 讨论软件机会为何仍在扩大，以及创始人如何避开实验室正在快跑的「Yellow Brick Road」。简介称 Dharmesh 建议先做窄市场、快速学习、把客户问题做完整；应用公司可在工作流、客户上下文和「工作发生的系统」里建立更持久的价值。他们也谈到 HubSpot 的 AI 实验、一人公司变多，以及更便宜的软件生产可能打开过去养不起软件公司的市场。节目页链向 Joe 的公开文章。不构成创业或投资建议。","advice":"做应用层、担心被模型实验室吞掉的创始人可以听。先读 Joe Schmidt 的公开文章再听会对「Yellow Brick Road」有上下文。约 59 分钟，偏创业方法，不是模型评测。","urls":[{"label":"节目页","href":"https://a16z.simplecast.com/episodes/hubspots-co-founder-on-finding-your-next-startup-idea-J9uhCiZA"},{"label":"Joe Schmidt 文章","href":"https://a16z.com/avoiding-death-on-the-yellow-brick-road/"},{"label":"Audio","href":"https://mgln.ai/e/1344/afp-848985-injected.calisto.simplecastaudio.com/3f86df7b-51c6-4101-88a2-550dba782de8/episodes/5398da9b-2c8d-4643-9306-55a8f357aea2/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&awCollectionId=3f86df7b-51c6-4101-88a2-550dba782de8&awEpisodeId=5398da9b-2c8d-4643-9306-55a8f357aea2&feed=JGE3yC0V"}],"addedAt":"2026-11-11","cover":"thumbs/a16z-dharmesh-shah-hubspot-startup-2026-11-10.jpg","media":{"audioUrl":"https://mgln.ai/e/1344/afp-848985-injected.calisto.simplecastaudio.com/3f86df7b-51c6-4101-88a2-550dba782de8/episodes/5398da9b-2c8d-4643-9306-55a8f357aea2/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&awCollectionId=3f86df7b-51c6-4101-88a2-550dba782de8&awEpisodeId=5398da9b-2c8d-4643-9306-55a8f357aea2&feed=JGE3yC0V","audioSource":"podcast-rss"},"hasEssay":false,"hasAnalysis":false,"hasTranscript":false}
